{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーこんばんは(´ω｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の記事の、今\nどこにいるでしょう?？問題\nを出してからずっとﾄﾞﾀﾊﾞﾀ\nしていてﾌﾞﾛｸﾞを書けず\nにいました。ｺﾞﾒﾝﾅｻｲ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しかったですか?なんて。\nごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは問題の答えっと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん?ん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょw正解者さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/crown.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多すぎ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです!kr\n友達とﾃﾞｨｽﾞﾆｰﾗﾝﾄﾞに\n行ってきました(´Д｀)ﾊﾞﾚﾊﾞﾚ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーなかなか分かりやす\nかったみたいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w\n皆さんあたしのこと知りすぎ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして!なあああんと\n盛り上がり過ぎて髪の毛を\nﾐﾆｰﾁｬﾝﾍｱｰにしてしまいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや〜18才ながら\n楽しみました?!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんだもんがち☆kr"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにﾎﾟｯﾌﾟｺｰﾝはﾊﾆｰ派。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫系はめちゃくちゃ叫ぶ派。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに高所恐怖症。\nｼﾞｪｯﾄｺｰｽﾀｰならいけます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしはななみんに背中を\nﾏｯｻｰｼﾞしてもらい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごに二の腕を\n触られ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんにはおしりを\n触られ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒っちにﾆﾔﾆﾔされて\nおります (´^ω^`)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"されるがままに〜(´^ω^`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふ、触れるのも悪くない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは〜斉藤優里のQ&A\n答えちゃお〜!のｺｰﾅｰです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.男性の好きな服装と髪型は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.その人自身に似合ってれば\nどんな服装、どんな髪型でも\nかっこよく見えるものです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.将来の芸能活動の夢は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.まだまだ色んなお仕事を\n経験中なので絞れませんが\nﾓﾃﾞﾙさん･女優さんなどを\n考えています。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/ring.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どうやったら早く\n覚えてもらえる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.毎回同じ洋服を着て来て\nくれるとか特徴的な髪型\nだったりですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お名前も言ってくれると\n〜さんって呼べるので嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/snow.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしも皆さんのこと\n早く覚えたい〜(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな休日の過ごし方は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.よっぽど疲れている時は\nﾓｶくんとまったりしてますが\n買い物"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bag.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がｽｷです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.自分の名前とあだ名で\n呼ばれるのどっちが嬉しい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あーこの質問wどっちも\n嬉しいな〜 うっあん･\nゆうちゃんなど新しく\nあだ名作ってもらったり〜\n何でも嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cafe.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ﾒﾝﾊﾞｰからも友達からも\nゆったんなので、たまに\n優里って呼ばれると新鮮で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっ!!(´･ω･`)って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっちゃいますけど。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな芸人さんは誰ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.芸人さんって言うよりは\nﾋﾟｶﾙの定理という番組が推し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cherryblossom.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに ﾃﾌﾞﾗｰｼｶww\n良かったら見てみてくださいw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.乃木坂ｵｰﾃﾞｨｼｮﾝで優里が\n歌った曲は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A. AKB48のMINTさんの\n『君について』という曲\nになります♪るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きなﾌﾙｰﾂは何ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んふ桃もすきだけどー\n1番じゃないんだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´Д｀)\nﾌﾙｰﾂﾅﾝﾊﾞｰﾜﾝは 梨です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/clover.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘くてｼｬｷｼｬｷ好きなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.最近寒くてなってきて\nなかなか布団から出れなくて\n困ってるんだけど良い方法ない?\nA.それ分かりますー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで2度寝しちゃう感じ\nですよね?!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/banana.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じや〜。\nんー良い方法ねー\n一緒に2度寝しようGO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ﾌｪﾚｯﾄの女の子名前を\n考えて欲しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ｺｺｱ ちゃんかな(´ω｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cute.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしがｺｺｱ好きだから〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ｱｲｽｺｺｱを作ろうとしたら\n粉がﾀﾞﾏになっちゃうですが\nどうしたらいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.最初にｱｲｽｺｺｱの元を\nいれて少しお湯を注いで\n粉を溶かしてからﾐﾙｸを\nいれて氷をいれれば\nあら完成"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/ring.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´ω｀)わお!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は明日朝が早いお仕事\nなのでせいらりん家☆に\nまいやん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とお泊まり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜今から楽しみ\nいっぱい語るぞ☆きゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいたん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}